---
interface Props { kind: 'debt' | 'matrix' | 'federated' | 'scale'; id: string; caption: string; }
const { kind, id, caption } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class={`ax-future ${kind}`} aria-labelledby={id}>
  <figcaption id={id}>{caption}</figcaption>
  {kind === 'debt' && <>
    <div class="legend"><span class="traditional">Traditional software</span><span class="assisted">AI-assisted maintenance</span><span class="complex">AI-assisted + complexity growth</span></div>
    <div class="debt-chart" role="img" aria-label="기술부채 총유지보수 비용의 세 가지 가정 경로">
      <span class="axis y">누적 유지보수 비용</span><span class="axis x">시간 →</span><i class="grid g1"></i><i class="grid g2"></i><i class="grid g3"></i><svg viewBox="0 0 560 250" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="line traditional" d="M25 215 C120 195 190 155 275 112 S425 45 535 25"/><path class="line assisted" d="M25 215 C120 204 195 183 285 161 S435 130 535 110"/><path class="line complex" d="M25 215 C125 203 205 174 290 145 S430 90 535 74"/></svg>
    </div>
    <p class="note">개념 모델: AI는 <em>단위 해결 비용</em>을 낮출 수 있지만, 더 빠른 생성이 <em>복잡성 총량</em>을 키우면 총비용은 다시 상승할 수 있다. 관측 데이터가 아니다.</p>
  </>}
  {kind === 'matrix' && <>
    <div class="matrix-chart" role="img" aria-label="의사결정 자율성과 시스템·조직 의존성에 따른 AX 실행 매트릭스">
      <div class="matrix-y-axis"><span>높음</span><b>의사결정 자율성</b><span>낮음</span></div>
      <div class="matrix-plot">
        <div class="cell autonomy"><em>높은 자율성 · 낮은 의존성</em><b>Autonomous<br/>Execution</b><small>작은 팀이 발견·구현·검증</small></div>
        <div class="cell distributed"><em>높은 자율성 · 높은 의존성</em><b>Distributed<br/>Integration</b><small>자율성은 있으나 연결·조율이 필요</small></div>
        <div class="cell approval"><em>낮은 자율성 · 낮은 의존성</em><b>Approval<br/>Bottleneck</b><small>기술보다 승인 흐름이 병목</small></div>
        <div class="cell coordination"><em>낮은 자율성 · 높은 의존성</em><b>Complex<br/>Coordination</b><small>공통 표준과 다자 조정이 선행</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="matrix-x-axis"><span>낮음</span><b>시스템·조직 의존성</b><span>높음</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="note">직원 수보다 의존성과 자율성이 AX의 속도를 더 잘 설명할 수 있다.</p>
  </>}
  {kind === 'federated' && <>
    <div class="federated"><section class="platform"><p>Central AI Platform</p><strong>공통 기반과 안전한 경계</strong><div><span>Data contracts / APIs</span><span>Security / IAM</span><span>Agent infrastructure</span><span>Deployment / observability</span><span>Evaluation / governance</span></div></section><div class="arrows" aria-hidden="true">↕&nbsp; ↕&nbsp; ↕</div><section class="cells"><article><b>Procurement AX Cell</b><span>Domain expert · Workflow ownership · KPI</span></article><article><b>Service AX Cell</b><span>Domain expert · Agent development · KPI</span></article><article><b>Finance AX Cell</b><span>Domain expert · Workflow ownership · KPI</span></article></section></div>
    <p class="note">중앙은 모든 애플리케이션을 대신 만들지 않는다. 재사용 가능한 기반과 통제 경계를 제공하고, 현업은 문제·운영·성과를 소유한다.</p>
  </>}
  {kind === 'scale' && <div class="scales"><article><p>Small business</p><b>Owner-builder</b><span>짧은 결정 거리<br/>인력·보안 자원 제약</span></article><article><p>Mid-market</p><b>AX sweet spot?</b><span>사업 규모·데이터·투자 여력<br/>상대적으로 짧은 조정 거리</span></article><article><p>Large enterprise</p><b>Federated cells</b><span>공통 플랫폼·통제 강점<br/>복잡한 의존성·승인 병목</span></article></div>}
</figure>

<style>
  .ax-future{--ink:#233a46;--accent:#a35838;--soft:#f6f1eb;--line:#d9d2c7;margin:2.5rem 0;padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:#fcfbf9;overflow:hidden}.ax-future figcaption{margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--ink)}.legend{display:flex;gap:.9rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700}.legend span:before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:18px;height:3px;margin-right:.35rem;vertical-align:middle;background:currentColor}.legend .traditional{color:#6d7376}.legend .assisted{color:#39756f}.legend .complex{color:#b46a49}.debt-chart{height:250px;margin:1rem 0 .3rem;position:relative;border-left:1px solid #aaa;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa}.debt-chart svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}.line{fill:none;stroke-width:4;vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke}.line.traditional{stroke:#6d7376}.line.assisted{stroke:#39756f}.line.complex{stroke:#b46a49;stroke-dasharray:8 5}.grid{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;border-top:1px dashed #e4dfd8}.g1{top:25%}.g2{top:50%}.g3{top:75%}.axis{position:absolute;color:#777;font-size:.7rem}.axis.y{transform:rotate(-90deg);transform-origin:left top;left:-.1rem;top:4rem}.axis.x{right:.5rem;bottom:.25rem}.note{margin:.65rem 0 0;color:#606765;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.6}.matrix-chart{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4.2rem minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-rows:minmax(228px,auto) auto;gap:.55rem .7rem;align-items:stretch}.matrix-y-axis{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:.25rem 0;color:#68706c;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700}.matrix-y-axis b{writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:rotate(180deg);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:.03em}.matrix-plot{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-template-rows:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2px;border:2px solid #91a09a;background:#91a09a}.cell{min-height:112px;padding:.85rem;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.cell em{color:#5c6964;font-size:.65rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:700}.cell b{margin:.35rem 0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.18}.cell small{font-size:.71rem;color:#59615f;line-height:1.4}.autonomy{background:#dfece6}.distributed{background:#e7edf0}.approval{background:#f3e6da}.coordination{background:#eee7e1}.matrix-x-axis{grid-column:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;color:#68706c;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700}.matrix-x-axis b{color:var(--ink);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.03em}.matrix-x-axis span:last-child{text-align:right}.federated{display:grid;gap:.8rem}.platform{border:1px solid #8fa9b8;background:#e8f0f4;border-radius:12px;padding:1rem}.platform p{margin:0;color:#3b6980;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.platform strong{display:block;margin:.25rem 0 .75rem}.platform div{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem}.platform span{padding:.3rem .5rem;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;font-size:.72rem}.arrows{text-align:center;color:#3b6980;font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:2rem}.cells{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem}.cells article{padding:.85rem;border:1px solid #d9d2c7;border-radius:10px;background:#fff}.cells b{display:block;font-size:.82rem}.cells span{display:block;margin-top:.45rem;color:#65706c;font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.4}.scales{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem}.scales article{min-height:150px;padding:1rem;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #ddd4c9;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.scales article:nth-child(2){border-color:#a35838;background:#fbf2eb}.scales p{margin:0;color:#a35838;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.scales b{margin:.5rem 0;font:700 1.05rem var(--serif)}.scales span{margin-top:auto;color:#626963;font-size:.77rem;line-height:1.5}@media(max-width:620px){.cells,.scales{grid-template-columns:1fr}.matrix-chart{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto;gap:.6rem}.matrix-y-axis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;padding:0}.matrix-y-axis b{writing-mode:horizontal-tb;transform:none}.matrix-y-axis span:last-child{text-align:right}.matrix-x-axis{grid-column:auto}.cell{min-height:126px}.debt-chart{height:190px}.arrows{letter-spacing:1rem}.axis.y{display:none}}@media(max-width:430px){.matrix-plot{gap:1px}.cell{min-height:112px;padding:.65rem}.cell em{font-size:.58rem}.cell b{font-size:.78rem}.cell small{font-size:.65rem}.matrix-x-axis,.matrix-y-axis{font-size:.62rem}.matrix-x-axis b,.matrix-y-axis b{font-size:.66rem}}
</style>
